sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as Agent/Caller
    participant Client as Browser Client
    participant Policy as Security Policy
    participant Repl as Runtime Bridge
    participant Extension as Chrome Extension
    participant Host as Native Host
    participant Site as Target Website

    Agent->>Client: setupBrowserRuntime
    Client->>Repl: Read runtime capabilities
    Client-->>Agent: Install agent.browsers API
    Agent->>Client: tab.goto(url)
    Client->>Policy: Base URL and optional local site_status
    Policy->>Policy: Origin and file/CDP authorization as applicable
    Client->>Extension: Browser protocol request
    Extension->>Host: Native message
    Host->>Site: Browser operation
    Site-->>Host: Page result
    Host-->>Extension: Protocol result
    Extension-->>Client: Structured response/error
    Client-->>Agent: Compatible result/error
